47
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,520
"Good vibes only!"

48
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:05,040
Move aside! Move!

49
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:05,760
Hurry!

50
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:06,520
Make way, please!

51
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:07,280
