52
00:03:07,920 --> 00:03:08,360
Hurry!

53
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:09,920
This way.

54
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:11,120
Hurry!

55
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:12,920
Hurry!

56
00:03:22,600 --> 00:03:23,360
