57
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:29,320
Don't be scared.

58
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:30,480
Come with me.

59
00:03:48,160 --> 00:03:49,040
We should be safer up here.

60
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:51,080
What disease is this?

61
00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:52,440
How is it this bad?

62
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:54,280
