65
00:03:57,760 --> 00:03:59,200
I can't tell you anything
that hasn't happened

66
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:00,080
or that isn't certain.

67
00:04:00,920 --> 00:04:01,760
Or who you are.

68
00:04:03,760 --> 00:04:04,440
My name's fine.

69
00:04:04,720 --> 00:04:05,400
My identity's off-limits.

70
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:07,080
Try it.

71
00:04:07,640 --> 00:04:08,280
Forget it.

72
00:04:08,760 --> 00:04:09,600
The second we try, it...

73
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:14,680
You'll forget everything

74
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:15,480
that just happened again.

75
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:17,440
You mean you're a time...

76
00:04:17,440 --> 00:04:17,920
Don't say it.

77
00:04:18,520 --> 00:04:19,880
It'll happen
even if you're the one who says it.

78
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:20,760
Seriously?

79
00:04:21,640 --> 00:04:22,360
Why do you think

80
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:24,120
I have a comeback ready
every time you crack a joke?

81
00:04:24,400 --> 00:04:25,200
It's because

82
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:26,720
I heard them ten minutes ago.

83
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:29,040
So you...

84
00:04:32,116 --> 00:04:32,916
You've done this a lot?

85
00:04:38,880 --> 00:04:40,040
So parallel universes...

86
00:04:44,146 --> 00:04:45,106
That reaction was genuine.

87
00:04:45,986 --> 00:04:47,586
You mean the virus will have a name,
and its development can't be changed.

88
00:04:47,906 --> 00:04:50,106
But the term "parallel universe"
has existed for quite a long time,

89
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:52,800
so of course saying it
won't send you back.

90
00:04:56,289 --> 00:04:58,129
So in your universe,

91
00:04:59,880 --> 00:05:01,240
I'm your wife?

92
00:05:04,080 --> 00:05:04,960
You're my wife.

93
00:05:05,755 --> 00:05:07,480
♪This is a story about you♪

94
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:08,160
Wifey.

95
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:10,120
Hubby.

96
00:05:13,111 --> 00:05:14,191
So when you see someone

97
00:05:14,191 --> 00:05:15,271
who looks exactly like your wife

98
00:05:15,431 --> 00:05:17,111
but is someone else entirely,

99
00:05:17,111 --> 00:05:18,455
