101
00:05:21,916 --> 00:05:23,436
If I suddenly vanished one day...

102
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:25,120
Who left? Who said you could leave?

103
00:05:26,840 --> 00:05:27,880
And someone showed up

104
00:05:28,102 --> 00:05:29,942
who looked just like me

105
00:05:30,404 --> 00:05:32,444
but didn't have my consciousness,

106
00:05:35,311 --> 00:05:36,311
