107
00:05:36,711 --> 00:05:37,431
Oh, please.

108
00:05:38,351 --> 00:05:38,711
(By the way,)

109
00:05:39,111 --> 00:05:40,151
(I forgot to tell you this.)

110
00:05:40,751 --> 00:05:41,991
(She has to fall in love with you)

111
00:05:42,391 --> 00:05:43,511
(for the drug to work.)

112
00:05:44,071 --> 00:05:45,431
(That's the core rule.)

113
00:05:46,002 --> 00:05:48,114
♪Feels like an unfinished dream♪

114
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:52,960
A lot goes through my mind.

115
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:55,160
Like what?

116
00:05:58,080 --> 00:05:59,000
Like...

117
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:01,576
♪You're the only rule
I've ever lived by♪

118
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:03,680
