she lives a long, healthy life.

119
00:06:07,681 --> 00:06:10,657
♪You're where my time ends♪

120
00:06:10,657 --> 00:06:12,193
♪The way I go♪

121
00:06:12,193 --> 00:06:14,209
♪Every tide♪

122
00:06:14,209 --> 00:06:15,841
♪Gives way to you♪

123
00:06:15,841 --> 00:06:19,777
♪Though the world breaks into dust♪

124
00:06:19,777 --> 00:06:21,217
♪At the end of time♪

125
00:06:21,926 --> 00:06:24,134
♪I wait for your echo♪

126
00:06:28,320 --> 00:06:29,000
Everyone, stay calm!

127
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:30,040
Don't do anything rash!

128
00:06:31,063 --> 00:06:31,639
Excuse me.

129
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:32,960
Excuse me, could you tell me...

130
00:06:34,280 --> 00:06:35,680
When will we be allowed to leave?

131
