135
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,720
Let me through!

136
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:46,680
Move!

137
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:47,800
Get out of the way!

138
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:49,000
We need to get to the hospital!

139
00:06:52,840 --> 00:06:54,400
In this universe, you don't get cancer.

140
00:06:55,160 --> 00:06:56,320
You die of an infectious disease.

141
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:58,720
W-What?

142
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:00,880
I promise I'll save you.

143
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:08,200
Get in. Hurry.

144
00:07:13,400 --> 00:07:15,000
Wait, what's going on?

145
00:07:15,880 --> 00:07:16,320
Duo...

146
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:18,600
What did you say?

147
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,360
Lin Duo, I love you.

148
00:07:24,440 --> 00:07:25,560
Do you have feelings for me now?

149
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:27,440
You...

150
00:07:28,280 --> 00:07:28,880
I...

151
00:07:30,080 --> 00:07:31,200
With everything that's going on,

152
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:32,000
