163
00:08:48,573 --> 00:08:49,293
Get to the point.

164
00:08:50,933 --> 00:08:51,493
I told you.

165
00:08:51,493 --> 00:08:53,053
She has to fall for you
before you can use the drug.

166
00:08:53,813 --> 00:08:55,413
A little sweet talk like that

167
00:08:55,613 --> 00:08:57,773
