before something happens to her

180
00:09:24,653 --> 00:09:25,493
and make sure

181
00:09:25,893 --> 00:09:27,013
she falls in love with you.

182
00:09:41,853 --> 00:09:42,693
Find her.

183
00:09:42,893 --> 00:09:43,973
Make her fall in love with you.

184
00:09:44,373 --> 00:09:45,653
Only when the drug takes effect

185
00:09:45,893 --> 00:09:47,613
