228
00:15:04,680 --> 00:15:06,408
♪Without♪

229
00:15:07,013 --> 00:15:08,093
You're asking me?

230
00:15:08,613 --> 00:15:09,533
Quick, let me see.

231
00:15:10,373 --> 00:15:10,813
I...

232
00:15:13,413 --> 00:15:14,013
Hey, easy! Easy!

233
00:15:15,493 --> 00:15:16,133
Harder!

234
00:15:16,693 --> 00:15:17,293
Harder!

235
00:15:17,293 --> 00:15:18,608
♪I want it♪

236
00:15:20,403 --> 00:15:21,459
♪I want it♪

237
00:15:23,010 --> 00:15:26,466
♪Without you by my side♪

238
00:15:33,728 --> 00:15:37,184
