242
00:15:56,550 --> 00:15:58,022
♪I remember♪

243
00:15:59,046 --> 00:16:01,094
♪The way you breathe♪

244
00:16:02,687 --> 00:16:05,119
♪Countless versions of me♪

245
00:16:06,136 --> 00:16:08,155
♪All point♪

246
00:16:08,155 --> 00:16:11,151
♪In the same direction♪

247
00:16:12,434 --> 00:16:14,034
♪Toward you♪

248
00:16:17,606 --> 00:16:19,398
♪I'll find you♪

249
00:16:19,736 --> 00:16:22,121
♪In the silence as the world is reborn♪

250
00:16:23,091 --> 00:16:24,876
♪I'll find you♪

251
00:16:25,426 --> 00:16:27,794
♪In the instant
before anything is decided♪

252
00:16:28,742 --> 00:16:30,790
♪I'll find you♪

253
00:16:31,174 --> 00:16:33,542
♪In the gaps
where time overlaps and slips♪

254
00:16:34,401 --> 00:16:36,257
♪I'll find you♪

255
00:16:40,737 --> 00:16:42,273
♪I'll find you♪

256
00:16:42,515 --> 00:16:45,011
♪In the promises left unsaid♪

257
00:16:45,821 --> 00:16:47,805
♪I'll find you♪

258
00:16:48,125 --> 00:16:50,685
♪In every pause between heartbeats♪

259
00:16:51,521 --> 00:16:53,569
♪I'll find you♪

260
00:16:53,889 --> 00:16:56,513
♪Where the last faint light fades♪

261
00:16:57,217 --> 00:16:59,137
♪I'll find you♪

262
00:17:03,002 --> 00:17:05,178
♪I'll find you♪
